    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "58b93dd4-729a-42d0-9721-2f08b5b00c2e",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Corsican Pt5: The Corsican",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111849987348",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2de69518-5954-4608-b2c4-462b89b0bd99).Image",
        "Description": "After tracing the Corsican&apos;s personal account, his identity has been confirmed as none other than Moses Lee, our initial client. We&apos;ve been played, 47. Lee used the ICA to get rid of loose ends, from the Mondegreen Agency to the Drinkmaker. He used funds stolen from the painter to hire the Drinkmaker, who poisoned two race marshals and replaced them with bribed marshals. Luckily, we cornered him financially by targeting the Kashmirian. Eliminate the Corsican and his corrupt marshals. Good luck.",
